Package: TabEHR
Type: Package
Title: Preprocess OMOP CDM Records and Build Downstream Task Data for EHR
    Foundation Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Study", "Team", email = "study@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ports the record preprocessing of the MedRep study
    (create_trajectory.py) to OHDSI SQL executed through DatabaseConnector and
    SqlRender, selects the study population, splits the patients once into a
    pretraining and a downstream group, derives the measurement quantile table
    from the pretraining patients only, and runs the SparseArray study package
    restricted to the downstream patients so that the task inputs and labels
    never see a pretraining patient. Every output is written per database so the
    same code runs at an external validation site with only its schema
    arguments changed.
